        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Malkovich, David Zayas, John Dahl, Matt Damon, Edward Norton\n- Products: Rounders, Empire of the Sun, The Killing Fields, Con Air, Of Mice and Men, Ripley's Game, Knockaround Guys, Being John Malkovich, Shadow of the Vampire, Burn After Reading, RED, Mulholland Falls, Dangerous Liaisons, Warm Bodies, Ghost World, Juno, The Perks of Being a Wallflower, Dexter, Oz, Annie, Gotham\n- Topics: film acting, film producing, poker films, television roles\n\nFacts:\n- John Malkovich has appeared in films including Empire of the Sun, The Killing Fields, Con Air, Of Mice and Men, Rounders, Ripley's Game, Knockaround Guys, Being John Malkovich, Shadow of the Vampire, Burn After Reading, RED, Mulholland Falls, Dangerous Liaisons, and Warm Bodies.\n- Rounders is a 1998 American drama film about the underground world of high-stakes poker.\n- Rounders was directed by John Dahl and starred Matt Damon and Edward Norton.\n- David Zayas played Osborne the cop in Rounders (1998).\n- David Zayas is best known for playing Angel Batista on Dexter, Enrique Morales on Oz, Lou the bodega owner in Annie (2014), and Sal Maroni on Gotham.\n- John Malkovich has also produced Ghost World, Juno, and The Perks of Being a Wallflower.",
